**`/opt/nxeon/worker/migrate-real.ts:~5773`** — *"worker/migrate.ts writes `Migration.status = "DONE"` unconditionally"*. No longer true since `migrate.ts:407-417`. Harmless, but it will mislead the next person deciding whether the gate exists.

